<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">CITY EXCHANGE</div><h1>Item market</h1><p>Browse the catalog and stock up for your next move.</p></div><a class="action-button" href="/inventory">My items ↗</a></div>
<div class="item-market-links"><a class="item-secondary" href="/openmarket">Player listings →</a><a class="item-secondary" href="/property#furnishing-store">Property store →</a><a class="item-secondary" href="/airport">Overseas shops →</a></div>
<p class="panel-intro">Shared stock rotates every hour. Some items stay, others disappear. Cheap items arrive in bulk; expensive items have only a few units. Next refresh: <time id="market-refresh" data-refresh="<%= restockAt %>"><%= new Date(restockAt*1000).toISOString().slice(11,16) %> UTC</time>.</p>
<p id="item-feedback" role="status" class="item-feedback" hidden></p>
